LEMI TRAFO EAD is a leading, fast-growing Bulgarian company, established in 1996. The main activity is the design and manufacturing of distribution and special type transformers.
- Oil-immersed transformers (from 25 up to 12,000 kVA, voltage class up to 36 kV);
- Cast resin distribution transformers (from 100 up to 5,000 kVA, voltage class up to 36 kV)
